{
  "about": "A reply that is only [quiet] (spaces trimmed, any case) is hidden: index.js quietReply, client.js quietText, Tether quietReply. `turns`: the steps of one completed turn (each a list of blocks: a string is a text, \"tool\" a tool call, \"think\" reasoning); `quiet` is the run rule (index.js quietRun, client.js quietTurnSet, Tether quietTexts) and `reply` the words of a turn that is news (index.js runReply, Tether newsReply). test/quiet-replies.test.mjs and the iOS QuietReplyTests read this table.",
